Spec: Monotonic server-authority time fence

Purpose:
  Prevent stalled or rolled-back wall time from extending the signed validity of newly received or replayed leases.

Owns:
  ./LeaseClock.cs

Must:
  Share one fence throughout a live Agent authorization generation and advance effective UTC by at least monotonic elapsed time.
  Preserve forward wall-time observations, permanently reject monotonic rollback and use the same held time provider for every receipt.
  Never reconstruct the fence from a token or reset it for each verification.
  Accept only forward server-Date observations from correlated pinned control responses, conservatively adding one second of date quantization and the complete measured request duration.
